    "introduction": "I understand your concerns about protecting your AirBnB property. It's important to balance security with guest privacy. Below are some discreet monitoring suggestions based on common practices up to 2023. Always prioritize legal compliance and transparency to maintain trust.",
    "suggestions": [
      {
        "method": "Discreet Security Cameras",
